      "sourceTextSha256": "37b46f1af522a09d08c10d0b25c20846c80609e69de9feb80d767d4f9bc20c6b",
      "text": "Day 9 · Along the Avenue of the Volcanoes, named by Alexander von Humboldt, to Hacienda San Agustín de Callo, built on the site of an Inca palace, one of the most important Inca monuments in Ecuador, where you can feed and photograph llamas (lunch not included). Free afternoon at Hacienda La Ciénega, a colonial hacienda on the Cotopaxi plains. (B)",
